{
  "about": "Captions and words (ADR-0060): a Value Field is captioned as Excel captions it, a caption a second Value Field would repeat takes a number, and the bundled editions' words. Transcribed from the C# engine's PivotWordsTests and JapaneseWordsTests.",
  "kind": "pivotReport",
  "data": "values",
  "locale": "en-US",
  "words": "english",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060, observed (run 17, item 4; R3 (a); the English (US) record, (a)): beside a Count of the same field, Count Numbers is \"Count of Value2\"",
      "layout": {
        "rows": [{"field": "Group"}],
        "values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"}, {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"}]
      },
      "records": [
        ["A", {"integer": "10"}],
        ["A", {"integer": "1"}],
        ["A", null],
        ["B", {"integer": "20"}],
        ["B", {"integer": "30"}]
      ],
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Row Labels", "Count of Value", "Count of Value2"],
        "lines": ["i A || 2 | 2", "i B || 2 | 2", "t Grand Total || 4 | 4"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Count of Value", "Count of Value2"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060, observed (R3 (d); the English (US) record, (d)): Count Numbers alone is \"Count of Value\", as Value Field Settings captions it",
      "layout": {"values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"}]},
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {"headers": ["Count of Value"], "lines": ["t  || 1"], "spans": [], "captions": ["Count of Value"]}
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060, by generalisation (Excel numbered the second of Count, then Count Numbers): the numbering follows the order of Values, whichever comes first",
      "layout": {
        "values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"}, {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"}]
      },
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Count of Value", "Count of Value2"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Count of Value", "Count of Value2"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060, observed (R3 (d), the Japanese edition, chosen in Value Field Settings and added through COM): Count Numbers is captioned データの個数 / Value, as Count is",
      "layout": {"values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"}]},
      "locale": "ja-JP",
      "words": "japanese",
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {"headers": ["データの個数 / Value"], "lines": ["t  || 1"], "spans": [], "captions": ["データの個数 / Value"]}
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060, by generalisation (the number observed in English only): in Japanese, a Count and a Count Numbers of one field are データの個数 / Value and データの個数 / Value2",
      "layout": {
        "values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"}, {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"}]
      },
      "locale": "ja-JP",
      "words": "japanese",
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["データの個数 / Value", "データの個数 / Value2"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["データの個数 / Value", "データの個数 / Value2"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060: a repeated caption takes the next free number, the second observed (run 17, item 14: Sum of Amount2), the third by generalisation",
      "layout": {
        "values": [
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"}
        ]
      },
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Count of Value", "Count of Value2", "Count of Value3"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Count of Value", "Count of Value2", "Count of Value3"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060: three Sums of one field are numbered",
      "layout": {
        "values": [
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "sum"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "sum"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "sum"}
        ]
      },
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Sum of Value", "Sum of Value2", "Sum of Value3"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Sum of Value", "Sum of Value2", "Sum of Value3"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060 (ExPivot's rule, not observed): the number also goes past a Pivot Field's caption, which a Value Field's caption may not repeat",
      "layout": {"values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"}]},
      "fields": [
        {"name": "Group", "type": "text"},
        {"name": "Value", "type": "number"},
        {"name": "Tally", "type": "number", "of": "Value", "caption": "Count of Value"}
      ],
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {"headers": ["Count of Value2"], "lines": ["t  || 1"], "spans": [], "captions": ["Count of Value2"]}
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060 (ExPivot's rule, not observed): a caption the user set is kept as typed, and a generated one it would repeat takes the next number free of it",
      "layout": {
        "values": [
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count", "caption": "Count of Value2"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"}
        ]
      },
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Count of Value", "Count of Value2", "Count of Value3"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Count of Value", "Count of Value2", "Count of Value3"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060 (ExPivot's rule, not observed): a caption the user set, standing after the Count it repeats, is kept, and that Count is numbered",
      "layout": {
        "values": [
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count", "caption": "Count of Value"}
        ]
      },
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Count of Value2", "Count of Value"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Count of Value2", "Count of Value"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060 (ExPivot's rule, not observed): a caption the user set is kept in Japanese too",
      "layout": {
        "values": [
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "countNumbers"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count", "caption": "データの個数 / Value"}
        ]
      },
      "locale": "ja-JP",
      "words": "japanese",
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["データの個数 / Value2", "データの個数 / Value"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["データの個数 / Value2", "データの個数 / Value"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060's note of 2026-10-12, observed (the English (US) record, (a) and (d)): ExPivot's English is Excel's English (US) edition's, Max of and Min of",
      "layout": {"values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "max"}, {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "min"}]},
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Max of Value", "Min of Value"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Max of Value", "Min of Value"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060's note of 2026-10-14, observed (R3 (a) and (d)): the English (UK) edition's words are bundled where they differ, Max. of and Min. of, and every other caption keeps the English",
      "layout": {
        "values": [
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "max"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "min"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "sum"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "count"},
          {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "stdDev"}
        ]
      },
      "locale": "en-GB",
      "words": "unitedKingdom",
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Max. of Value", "Min. of Value", "Sum of Value", "Count of Value", "StdDev of Value"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 | #DIV/0!"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Max. of Value", "Min. of Value", "Sum of Value", "Count of Value", "StdDev of Value"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060's note of 2026-10-14, ADR-0152: the engine reads no culture for its words: under an en-GB culture without the words, it keeps the English (US) ones",
      "layout": {"values": [{"field": "Value", "aggregation": "max"}, {"field": "Value", "aggregation": "min"}]},
      "locale": "en-GB",
      "also": ["captions"],
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Max of Value", "Min of Value"],
        "lines": ["t  || 1 | 1"],
        "spans": [],
        "captions": ["Max of Value", "Min of Value"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060: a report laid out with the Japanese words, as a server would lay it out",
      "layout": {
        "rows": [{"field": "Region"}],
        "values": [{"field": "Amount", "aggregation": "sum"}, {"field": "Region", "aggregation": "count"}]
      },
      "data": "sales",
      "words": "japanese",
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["行ラベル", "合計 / Amount", "データの個数 / Region"],
        "lines": ["i East || 180 | 3", "i North || 10 | 1", "i West || 90 | 2", "i (空白) || 5 |", "t 総計 || 285 | 6"],
        "spans": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0060: the words never follow the culture on their own; a Japanese culture without the words stays English",
      "layout": {"rows": [{"field": "Region"}], "values": [{"field": "Amount", "aggregation": "sum"}]},
      "data": "sales",
      "locale": "ja-JP",
      "expect": {
        "headers": ["Row Labels", "Sum of Amount"],
        "lines": ["i East || 180", "i North || 10", "i West || 90", "i (blank) || 5", "t Grand Total || 285"],
        "spans": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
